&lt;li&gt;📕 &lt;a class="link" href="https://amzn.com/dp/B07D23CFGR" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Atomic Habits: An Easy &amp;amp; Proven Way to Build Good Habits &amp;amp; Break Bad Ones&lt;/a&gt; - James Clear &lt;br&gt;
